      "writtenOn": "2024-01-29T23:58:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We previously tested for no sdcardfs, but due to circumstances like this, that test is currently marked as IGNORE, since we don\u0027t currently have any means of detecting launch kernel vs current kernel.",
